* Zoezi: Miti ya jozi inayolingana

*1.* Tekeleza kitendakazi cha `Walk`.

*2.* Jaribu kitendakazi cha `Walk`.

Kitendakazi `tree.New(k)` huunda mti wa jozi wenye muundo wa nasibu (lakini uliopangwa kila wakati) unaohifadhi thamani `k`, `2k`, `3k`, ..., `10k`.

Unda chaneli mpya `ch` na uanzishe kipitiaji:

	go Walk(tree.New(1), ch)

Kisha soma na uchapishe thamani 10 kutoka kwenye chaneli. Zinapaswa kuwa nambari 1, 2, 3, ..., 10.

*3.* Tekeleza kitendakazi cha `Same` kwa kutumia `Walk` ili kubaini kama `t1` na `t2` huhifadhi thamani zilezile.

*4.* Jaribu kitendakazi cha `Same`.

`Same(tree.New(1),`tree.New(1))` inapaswa kurejesha true, na `Same(tree.New(1),`tree.New(2))` inapaswa kurejesha false.

Nyaraka za `Tree` zinapatikana [[https://godoc.org/golang.org/x/tour/tree#Tree][hapa]].

.play concurrency/exercise-equivalent-binary-trees.go
